s for keeps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate a Dead World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b Face Eerie Encounters: The path is littered with spectral pleas and mysterious events. Each encounter is a story shaped by your choices, offering terrible bargains, powerful boons, and chilling glimpses into the grim world you are trapped in. Choose wisely\u2014every decision builds your legacy... or writes your epitaph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house always wins. Unless you cheat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["GG Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/54016a3f671b9996199f5b33161091b13165713e/header.jpg?t=1761825413","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3756340/1590897200/6cb562bf205d66760240631971bf0cd34723646e/1761546474/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761574339","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3756340/1590897200/6cb562bf205d66760240631971bf0cd34723646e/1761546474/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761574339","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3756340/1590897200/6cb562bf205d66760240631971bf0cd34723646e/1761546474/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761574339","id":257222979,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257222979/movie480.mp4?t=1761574339","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257222979/movie_max.mp4?t=1761574339"},"name":"Horror Fest Update - Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257222979/41150ac9f5f6cea2a62f5735eb6a99c1d7e89b9e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761574339","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steams